# golden 與 fixtures 需位元穩定，固定使用 LF（避免 Windows autocrlf 造成比對失敗）
packages/*/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
*.golden.json text eol=lf

# Compressed complete legacy replay fixture must not undergo newline conversion.
packages/core/tests/fixtures/questionLegacy32.v2-v3.json.gz binary

# Pages corresponding-source ZIP: exclude ancillary developer tools and
# external comparison records, not any code/assets needed to build the site.
# A Git checkout keeps all of these; CI therefore runs the same test suite.
/.agents/skills export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/integrationCases.ts export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/validation/humandesign-reference.* export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/validation/humandesign-validation-report.md export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/validation/jyotish-cases.json export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/validation/jyotish-thirdparty.json export-ignore
/packages/core/tests/fixtures/validation/jyotish-validation-report.md export-ignore
